aenous React Web3 snippets","topics":[],"score":224514,"global_rank":152216},{"name":"karmjeetnamol/Book-Search_Engine","owner":"karmjeetnamol","html_url":"https://github.com/karmjeetnamol/Book-Search_Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224514,"global_rank":152217},{"name":"karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","owner":"karmjeetnamol","html_url":"https://github.com/karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This project was bootstrapped with Create React App.  Acceptance Criteria GIVEN a single-page application portfolio for a web developer WHEN I load the portfolio THEN I am presented with a page containing a header, a section for content, and a footer WHEN I view the header THEN I am presented with the developer's name and navigation with titles corresponding to different sections of the portfolio WHEN I view the navigation titles THEN I am presented with the titles About Me, Portfolio, Contact, and Resume, and the title corresponding to the current section is highlighted WHEN I click on a navigation title THEN I am presented with the corresponding section below the navigation without the page reloading and that title is highlighted WHEN I load the portfolio the first time THEN the About Me title and section are selected by default WHEN I am presented with the About Me section THEN I see a recent photo of the developer and a short bio about me WHEN I am presented with the Portfolio section THEN I see titled images of three of the developer\u2019s applications with links to both the deployed applications and the corresponding GitHub repository WHEN I am presented with the Contact section THEN I see a contact form with fields for a name, an email address, and a message WHEN I move my cursor out of one of the form fields without entering text THEN I receive a notification that this field is required WHEN I enter text into the email address field THEN I receive a notification if I have entered an invalid email address WHEN I view the footer THEN I am presented with text or icon links to the developer\u2019s GitHub and LinkedIn profiles.  In the project directory, you can run: npm start Runs the app in the development mode. Open http://localhost:3000 to view it in your browser.  The page will reload when you make changes. You may also see any lint errors in the console.","topics":[],"score":224514,"global_rank":152218},{"name":"mcote7/voxel-party","owner":"mcote7","html_url":"https://github.com/mcote7/voxel-party","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"\ud83d\udd25 immersive collection of my voxel art","topics":[],"score":224514,"global_rank":152225},{"name":"calvin-kim13/noteTaker","owner":"calvin-kim13","html_url":"https://github.com/calvin-kim13/noteTaker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"The Note Taker allows users to enter a title and text of anything they want. It could be used to keep a track of grocery lists and users are also able to save it and click back on it in order to view that note again. This project was developed with Express.js and deployed with heroku.","topics":["expressjs","heroku","html","javascript"],"score":224514,"global_rank":152226},{"name":"taegorov/shopping-list","owner":"taegorov","html_url":"https://github.com/taegorov/shopping-list","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224514,"global_rank":152228},{"name":"carljc3/after-coding-bootcamp-web","owner":"carljc3","html_url":"https://github.com/carljc3/after-coding-bootcamp-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":1,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224512,"global_rank":152231},{"name":"cottenpanda/Interactive-calculator","owner":"cottenpanda","html_url":"https://github.com/cottenpanda/Interactive-calculator","stars":